      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Bedrock Managed Knowledge Base now supports single-shot Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) and retrieval-only requests through AgenticRetrieveStream .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:20.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can now use the same API for both of the employee’s questions: single-shot RAG for the checklist lookup and agentic retrieval for the cross-policy comparison.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:20.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We use an illustrative internal banking policy assistant to show how single-shot RAG handles direct questions and how agentic retrieval supports comparisons across policy documents.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:20.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Single-shot RAG uses one foundation model call to generate the answer, which can reduce latency and model usage compared with agentic retrieval.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:20.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "A value of n buys up to n minus 1 agentic planning rounds, with the last iteration reserved for generating the response.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:20.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Single-shot retrieval doesn’t mean a single knowledge base.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:20.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With Amazon Bedrock Managed Knowledge Base, you can now combine single-shot RAG, agentic retrieval, and retrieval-only requests in one assistant through AgenticRetrieveStream .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:20.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Compare single-shot RAG with your current agentic configuration using the same knowledge base.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:20.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Keep agentic retrieval where additional searches improve the answer, use single-shot RAG where one retrieval is sufficient, and disable generation when the task is source review.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:20.532Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
